  "description": "A clean-room, dependency-light C# reimplementation of the GraphViz `dot` hierarchical (Sugiyama-style) layout engine for directed graphs. Parse the DOT language, run the full five-phase pipeline (acyclic → network-simplex ranking → median+transpose crossing minimization → coordinate assignment → spline routing), and emit SVG, GraphViz `-Tplain`/`-Tdot`, or computed coordinates you can render yourself. Ranks, crossings and node sizing are verified against the real dot.exe. Written from the published papers and the public DOT spec — no GraphViz source is transliterated.",
